### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# Mostly personal/machine state, but a few project-level files are worth checking in so a fresh
# clone opens in IntelliJ already wired up: the H2 data source (kills the "unresolved column"
# false-positive on JPA/@Table/@JoinColumn strings), SDK/compiler settings, and the run configs.
.idea/*
!.idea/.gitignore
!.idea/dataSources.xml
!.idea/db-forest-config.xml
!.idea/misc.xml
!.idea/compiler.xml
!.idea/vcs.xml
!.idea/encodings.xml
!.idea/jarRepositories.xml
!.idea/runConfigurations/
!.idea/runConfigurations/**
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

